\\": \\\"aasb7\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"AASB 7 Financial Instruments: Disclosures\\\",\\n      \\\"issuer\\\": \\\"Australian Accounting Standards Board\\\",\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"primary_standard\\\",\\n      \\\"access_status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary\\\",\\n      \\\"official_url\\\": \\\"https://www.aasb.gov.au/admin/file/content105/c9/AASB7_08-15_COMPdec22_01-23.pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"retrieved_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-03T01:04:26.758268+00:00\\\",\\n      \\\"inspected_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-03T01:14:19.665461+00:00\\\",\\n      \\\"retained\\\": {\\n        \\\"path\\\": \\\"docs/design/research/p08-v1/aasb7.pdf\\\",\\n        \\\"sha256\\\": \\\"215bbd5ea6850443303046ad5c8587467a5b643910d2a2b5716569be2644a1bc\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"text\\\": {\\n        \\\"path\\\": \\\"docs/design/research/p08-v1/aasb7.txt\\\",\\n        \\\"sha256\\\": \\\"c825e043e0a120f15c1fde3236ae77bc1731ef527f6b388a483180e38da8a39d\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"edition\\\": \\\"31 December 2022 compilation; amendments through 15 December 2022\\\",\\n      \\\"jurisdiction\\\": \\\"AU\\\",\\n      \\\"entity_scope\\\": \\\"for-profit\\\",\\n      \\\"tier\\\": \\\"Tier 1\\\",\\n      \\\"period_start_inclusive\\\": \\\"2023-01-01\\\",\\n      \\\"period_start_exclusive\\\": \\\"2026-07-01\\\",\\n      \\\"transition_conditions\\\": \\\"Use this compilation only for annual periods with start in the stated interval; no optional early adoption of subsequent amendments. Synthetic cases use calendar 2024 and 2025.\\\",\\n      \\\"applicability_anchor\\\": \\\"Cover and compilation preamble; Comparison with IAS/IFRS, Tier 1.\\\",\\n      \\\"inspected_paragraphs\\\": [\\n        \\\"7\\\",\\n        \\\"8(g)\\\",\\n        \\\"20(b)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"limits\\\": \\\"Only listed paragraphs inspected. Official Australian adoption; no universal IFRS jurisdiction conclusion.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"claims\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"recognition\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb9\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"3.1.1\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 10,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"when, and only when, the entity becomes party to the contractual provisions of the instrument\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"Recognise the contractual financial liability when the issuer becomes party; proceeds are assumed equal to instrument fair value.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"fair_value\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb9\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"5.1.1\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 18,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"measure a financial asset or financial liability at its fair value plus or minus\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"Initial measurement uses fair value; this slice assumes proceeds equal fair value and no transaction costs.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"classification\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb132\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"22\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 12,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"fixed number of its own equity instruments in exchange for a fixed amount of cash or another financial asset is an equity instrument.\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"Fixed-for-fixed equity classification, conditional on ordinary non-puttable shares, functional currency and exclusion of settlement alternatives/contingencies.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"split\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb132\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"AG30–AG35\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 25,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"On initial recognition, the fair value of the liability component is the present value of the contractually determined stream of future cash flows\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"AG31(a): discount liability cash flows at comparable non-convertible market yield; paragraphs 28–32 allocate residual proceeds to equity.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"residual_equity\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb132\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"28–32\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 14,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"the equity component is assigned the residual amount after deducting from the fair value of the instrument as a whole\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"Paragraph 31 supplies residual allocation. Equity is not remeasured; retained on expiry is a local deduction from paragraph 22 and liability-only extinguishment, not a separate quoted redemption rule.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"measurement\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb9\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"4.2.1\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 16,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"An entity shall classify all financial liabilities as subsequently measured at amortised cost, except for:\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"Ordinary liability uses amortised cost. Exclude fair-value designation/trading, derivatives, guarantees, transfer liabilities, below-market commitments and business-combination contingent consideration.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"interest\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb9\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"Appendix A: effective interest\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 45,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"the allocation and recognition of the interest revenue or interest expense in profit or loss over the relevant period.\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"Effective-interest method allocates interest expense; use opening liability times the assumed exact annual effective yield.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"amortised_cost\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb9\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"Appendix A: amortised cost\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 44,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"minus the principal repayments, plus or minus the cumulative amortisation using the effective interest method\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"Amortised cost roll-forward follows contractual payments and cumulative effective-interest amortisation.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"redemption\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb9\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"3.3.1–3.3.3\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 14,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"when, and only when, it is extinguished – ie when the obligation specified in the contract is discharged or cancelled or expires.\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"Remove the discharged liability; paragraph 3.3.3 difference is profit/loss. At this exact maturity, consideration equals carrying amount, so zero settlement gain/loss.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"conversion\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb132\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"AG30–AG35\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 25,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"On conversion of a convertible instrument at maturity, the entity derecognises the liability component and recognises it as equity.\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"AG32: maturity conversion reclassifies liability to equity, leaves original equity within equity and produces no gain/loss.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"note_carrying\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb7\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"8(g)\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 8,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"financial liabilities measured at amortised cost.\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"8(g), read with paragraph 8 lead-in: disclose carrying amounts of financial liabilities at amortised cost on the face or in notes.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"note_interest\\\",\\n      \\\"authority_id\\\": \\\"aasb7\\\",\\n      \\\"anchors\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"20(b)\\\",\\n          \\\"pdf_page\\\": 12,\\n          \\\"quote\\\": \\\"total interest revenue and total interest expense (calculated using the effective interest method)\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"supported_statement\\\": \\\"20(b): disclose effective-interest totals for liabilities not measured at fair value through profit/loss. This is selected note content only.\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"inspected_primary_conditional\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"access_attempts\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"aasb9\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.aasb.gov.au/admin/file/content105/c9/AASB9_12-14_COMPdec22_01-23.pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"retrieved_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-03T01:04:23.430065+00:00\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": 200,\\n      \\\"final_url\\\": \\\"https://www.aasb.gov.au/admin/file/content105/c9/AASB9_12-14_COMPdec22_01-23.pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"content_type\\\": \\\"application/pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"docs/design/research/p08-v1/aasb9.pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"sha256\\\": \\\"8f5a87c67a76c193bedeee8ea7f3f21556b3886eee4184a62c7045256b3f84f0\\\",\\n      \\\"bytes\\\": 2195229\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"fasb2020_06\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://storage.fasb.org/ASU%202020-06_0.pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"retrieved_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-03T01:04:25.541355+00:00\\\",\\n      \\\"error\\\": \\\"HTTP Error 403: Forbidden\\\",\\n      \\\"access_status\\\": \\\"unavailable\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"aasb7\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.aasb.gov.au/admin/file/content105/c9/AASB7_08-15_COMPdec22_01-23.pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"retrieved_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-03T01:04:26.758268+00:00\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": 200,\\n      \\\"final_url\\\": \\\"https://www.aasb.gov.au/admin/file/content105/c9/AASB7_08-15_COMPdec22_01-23.pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"content_type\\\": \\\"application/pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"docs/design/research/p08-v1/aasb7.pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"sha256\\\": \\\"215bbd5ea6850443303046ad5c8587467a5b643910d2a2b5716569be2644a1bc\\\",\\n      \\\"bytes\\\": 1329611\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"mof22_candidate\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://kjs.mof.gov.cn/zhengcefabu/201704/t20170406_2579238.htm\\\",\\n      \\\"retrieved_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-03T01:05:21.892559+00:00\\\",\\n      \\\"access_status\\\": \\\"unavailable\\\",\\n      \\\"error\\\": \\\"HTTP Error 502: Bad Gateway\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"eu2023_1803\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX:32023R1803\\\",\\n      \\\"retrieved_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-03T01:05:57.801400+00:00\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": 202,\\n      \\\"final_url\\\": \\\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX:32023R1803\\\",\\n      \\\"path\\\": \\\"docs/design/research/p08-v1/eu2023_1803.html\\\",\\n      \\\"sha256\\\": \\\"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\\\",\\n      \\\"bytes\\\": 0\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"note_links\\\": {\\n    \\\"financing_carrying\\\": [\\n      \\\"note_carrying\\\",\\n      \\\"measurement\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"financing_interest\\\": [\\n      \\\"note_interest\\\",\\n      \\\"interest\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"financing_equity\\\": [\\n      \\\"split\\\",\\n      \\\"residual_equity\\\",\\n      \\\"conversion\\\"\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \\\"research\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"docs/design/research/standards/actus-techspecs.tex\\\",\\n      \\\"sha256\\\": \\\"ceab659d35dca615287360b9266cf105a9e2a79e99ee75253ea8b3abc5af91d9\\\",\\n      \\\"inspected_sections\\\": [\\n        \\\"State Variables (sec:statevarsnotat)\\\",\\n        \\\"Contract Events (sec:events)\\\",\\n        \\\"Payoff Functions (sec:pof)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"decision\\\": \\\"defer integration; no ACTUS algorithm, schedule, code or forecast mechanism adopted\\\",\\n      \\\"support\\\": \\\"Retained technical specification distinguishes dated events, state changes and cash-flow functions.\\\",\\n      \\\"transfer_limit\\\": \\\"Implementation uses an explicit user-specified annual schedule and local accounting transitions. No ACTUS compatibility, official-code equivalence, empirical evaluation or company-simulation validity claim. Broader method/theory/evaluation and code audit required before future adoption.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"method_queue\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"revenue\\\",\\n      \\\"operation_boundary\\\": \\\"single contract, performance obligation, delivery/collection\\\",\\n      \\\"missing_authority\\\": \\\"Applicable AASB 15/ASC 606/ASBE 14 primary paragraphs\\\",\\n      \\\"unresolved_interpretation\\\": \\\"Distinct promises, variable-consideration constraint and timing\\\",\\n      \\\"next_exact_case\\\": \\\"Two obligations, advance cash, partial delivery and refund\\\",\\n      \\\"requirements\\\": [\\n        \\\"MC15\\\",\\n        \\\"MC19\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"gaps\\\": [\\n        \\\"G4\\\",\\n        \\\"G7\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"internal_follow_up\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"tax\\\",\\n      \\\"operation_boundary\\\": \\\"current tax and one temporary difference\\\",\\n      \\\"missing_authority\\\": \\\"Applicable AASB 112/ASC 740/ASBE 18 and tax law\\\",\\n      \\\"unresolved_interpretation\\\": \\\"Tax base, enacted rates and deferred-tax recoverability\\\",\\n      \\\"next_exact_case\\\": \\\"Two-year depreciation difference and loss carryforward\\\",\\n      \\\"requirements\\\": [\\n        \\\"MC15\\\",\\n        \\\"MC19\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"gaps\\\": [\\n        \\\"G4\\\",\\n        \\\"G7\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"internal_follow_up\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"leases\\\",\\n      \\\"operation_boundary\\\": \\\"lessee recognition through one remeasurement\\\",\\n      \\\"missing_authority\\\": \\\"Applicable AASB 16/ASC 842/ASBE 21\\\",\\n      \\\"unresolved_interpretation\\\": \\\"Renewal certainty, lease term and discount-rate reset\\\",\\n      \\\"next_exact_case\\\": \\\"Lease commencement, coupon, changed option and termination\\\",\\n      \\\"requirements\\\": [\\n        \\\"MC15\\\",\\n        \\\"MC19\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"gaps\\\": [\\n        \\\"G4\\\",\\n        \\\"G7\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"internal_follow_up\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"FX\\\",\\n      \\\"operation_boundary\\\": \\\"foreign-currency payable then settlement; translation separate\\\",\\n      \\\"missing_authority\\\": \\\"Applicable AASB 121/ASC 830/ASBE 19\\\",\\n      \\\"unresolved_interpretation\\\": \\\"Functional currency, monetary classification and translation reserves\\\",\\n      \\\"next_exact_case\\\": \\\"Year-end payable remeasurement and next-year cash settlement\\\",\\n      \\\"requirements\\\": [\\n        \\\"MC06\\\",\\n        \\\"MC15\\\",\\n        \\\"MC19\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"gaps\\\": [\\n        \\\"G4\\\",\\n        \\\"G7\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"internal_follow_up\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"complex_groups\\\",\\n      \\\"operation_boundary\\\": \\\"acquisition, NCI, eliminations and disposal\\\",\\n      \\\"missing_authority\\\": \\\"Applicable AASB 3/10/128, ASC 805/810 and ASBE 20/33\\\",\\n      \\\"unresolved_interpretation\\\": \\\"Control, substantive rights, common control and NCI measurement\\\",\\n      \\\"next_exact_case\\\": \\\"Mid-year acquisition, intercompany sale, partial disposal\\\",\\n      \\\"requirements\\\": [\\n        \\\"MC06\\\",\\n        \\\"MC15\\\",\\n        \\\"MC19\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"gaps\\\": [\\n        \\\"G4\\\",\\n        \\\"G7\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"internal_follow_up\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"method\\\": \\\"bonds\\\",\\n      \\\"operation_boundary\\\": \\\"extend issuer lifecycle beyond fixed maturity conversion\\\",\\n      \\\"missing_authority\\\": \\\"Applicable ASC 470/815, ASU 2020-06 and ASBE 22/37; further AASB provisions\\\",\\n      \\\"unresolved_interpretation\\\": \\\"Early repurchase, inducement, modification, embedded terms, default and disclosure completeness\\\",\\n      \\\"next_exact_case\\\": \\\"Early cash repurchase with separated consideration and reconciled equity\\\",\\n      \\\"requirements\\\": [\\n        \\\"MC17\\\",\\n        \\\"MC19\\\",\\n        \\\"MC29\\\",\\n        \\\"MC30\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"gaps\\\": [\\n        \\\"G4\\\",\\n        \\\"G7\\\",\\n        \\\"G8\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"internal_follow_up\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"prior_blocks\\\": \\\"The historical FASB ASU 2015-11 and MoF index blocks remain preserved in standards-support.json. New attempts above are distinct document routes; no challenge bypass or unchanged retry.\\\",\\n  \\\"uninspected_standards\\\": [\\n    \\\"ASC 470/815 and ASU 2020-06\\\",\\n    \\\"ASBE 22/37\\\",\\n    \\\"EU-endorsed IAS 32/IFRS 9\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"inspection_limit\\\": \\\"Quotes and page resolution establish retained support, not exhaustive reading or full accounting compliance. Synthetic eligibility declarations need actual contract/yield evidence before real application.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T233421-cea9e631/P08/execution-1/repair-1.log:23:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_8\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc \\\"sed -n '220,520p' scripts/corporate_financing_v1.py\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"        postings = {}\\n        claims = []\\n        if kind == 'issue':\\n            postings = {'cash': rational(c.proceeds), 'liability': -self.initial_liability,\\n                        'conversion_equity': -(rational(c.proceeds) - self.initial_liability)}\\n            principal = rational(c.principal)\\n            claims = ['recognition', 'classification', 'split']\\n        elif kind == 'accrue':\\n            interest = -ledger['liability'] * rational(c.comparable_yield)\\n            postings = {'interest_expense': interest, 'liability': -interest}\\n            claims = ['measurement', 'interest']\\n        elif kind == 'coupon':\\n            coupon = rational(c.annual_coupon)\\n            postings = {'liability': coupon, 'cash': -coupon}\\n            claims = ['measurement', 'redemption']\\n        elif kind in ('redeem', 'convert'):\\n            carrying = -ledger['liability']\\n            if carrying != rational(c.principal):\\n                raise Unsupported('maturity liability does not equal principal')\\n            postings = {'liability': carrying, 'cash' if kind == 'redeem' else 'share_equity': -carrying}\\n            if kind == 'convert':\\n                shares += c.conversion_shares\\n            principal = Fraction(0)\\n            claims = ['redemption' if kind == 'redeem' else 'conversion']\\n        else:\\n            raise Unsupported('unsupported event')\\n        for account, amount in postings.items():\\n            ledger[account] += amount\\n        if sum(postings.values()) or sum(ledger.values()) or ledger['cash'] < 0 or ledger['liability'] > 0:\\n            raise Unsupported('journal/state/funding invariant')\\n        # Commit only after all validation, including funding and measurement.\\n        entry = {'id': event_id, 'kind': kind, 'date': day, 'entity': c.entity,\\n                 'book': c.book, 'currency': c.currency, 'postings_debit_positive': postings,\\n                 'claims': claims, 'state_after': deepcopy(ledger)}\\n        self._ledger, self._shares, self._principal = ledger, shares, principal\\n        self._journal.append(entry)\\n        self._used.add(event_id)\\n        self._position += 1\\n        return deepcopy(entry)\\n\\n    def notes(self):\\n        periods = []\\n        opening_carrying = Fraction(0)\\n        for year in range(iso(self.contract.issue_date).year,\\n                          iso(self.contract.issue_date).year + self.contract.years):\\n            rows = [x for x in self._journal if x['date'].startswith(str(year))]\\n            if not rows:\\n                continue\\n            def movement(kind, account):\\n                return sum((x['postings_debit_positive'].get(account, Fraction(0))\\n                            for x in rows if x['kind'] == kind), Fraction(0))\\n            issued = -movement('issue', 'liability')\\n            interest = movement('accrue', 'interest_expense')\\n            coupons = movement('coupon', 'liability')\\n            settled = movement('redeem', 'liability') + movement('convert', 'liability')\\n            closing = -rows[-1]['state_after']['liability']\\n            if opening_carrying + issued + interest - coupons - settled != closing:\\n                raise Unsupported('note roll-forward mismatch')\\n            periods.append({'period_start': f'{year}-01-01', 'period_end': f'{year}-12-31',\\n                            'opening_liability': opening_carrying, 'issue_liability': issued,\\n                            'interest_expense': interest, 'coupons': coupons, 'settlement_liability': settled,\\n                            'closing_liability': closing, 'event_ids': [x['id'] for x in rows]})\\n            opening_carrying = closing\\n        return {'periods': periods, 'links': deepcopy(self.authority.records['note_links']),\\n                'mandatory_disclosure_scope': 'selected carrying amount and interest only; not a complete AASB 7 note',\\n                'conversion_equity': -self._ledger['conversion_equity'],\\n                'issued_share_equity': -self._ledger['share_equity'], 'issued_shares': self._shares}\\n\\n\\ndef run_case(contract=None, settlement='redeem', opening_cash='20', authority=None):\\n    c = contract or Contract()\\n    book = BondBook(c, authority, opening_cash)\\n    book.apply('issue', 'issue', c.issue_date)\\n    for i, day in enumerate(c.coupon_dates(), 1):\\n        book.apply(f'accrue-{i}', 'accrue', day)\\n        book.apply(f'coupon-{i}', 'coupon', day)\\n    book.apply('settlement', settlement, c.coupon_dates()[-1])\\n    return wire({'contract': vars(c), 'settlement': settlement, 'opening_cash': rational(opening_cash),\\n                 'initial_liability': book.initial_liability, 'state': book.state, 'notes': book.notes()})\\n\\n\\ndef compare_same_facts(contract=None, authority=None):\\n    c = contract or Contract()\\n    facts = wire(vars(c))\\n    # Hash common economics without changing terms for an unavailable rule set.\\n    economic = {k: v for k, v in facts.items() if k not in ('basis', 'jurisdiction', 'tier', 'entity_scope', 'book')}\\n    digest = sha256(json.dumps(economic, sort_keys=True).encode()).hexdigest()\\n    case = run_case(c, authority=authority)\\n    rows = [{'standard': 'AASB', 'jurisdiction': 'AU', 'facts_sha256': digest,\\n             'status': 'supported_bounded', 'initial_liability': case['initial_liability'],\\n             'initial_equity': str(rational(c.proceeds) - rational(case['initial_liability'])),\\n             'total_interest': case['state']['ledger']['interest_expense'],\\n             'claims': list(REQUIRED)}]\\n    for standard, jurisdiction, missing in [\\n        ('US GAAP', 'US', 'Applicable ASC 470/815 and ASU 2020-06 text, adoption and exceptions uninspected; official PDF 403.'),\\n        ('ASBE', 'CN', 'Official CAS 22/37 text, applicable edition and entity transition uninspected; MoF route 502.'),\\n        ('EU-endorsed IFRS', 'EU', 'Applicable endorsed IAS 32/IFRS 9 text and amendments uninspected; EUR-Lex returned empty 202.')]:\\n        rows.append({'standard': standard, 'jurisdiction': jurisdiction, 'facts_sha256': digest,\\n                     'status': 'unresolved', 'initial_liability': None, 'initial_equity': None,\\n                     'total_interest': None, 'claims': [], 'missing': missing})\\n    return {'economic_facts': economic, 'rows': rows, 'supported_difference': None,\\n            'criterion_status': 'incomplete: no second inspected applicable standard',\\n            'interpretation': 'No numerical difference or equivalence is established; Australian adoption is not universal IFRS authority.'}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T233421-cea9e631/P08/execution-1/repair-1.log:25:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_9\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc 'cat data/accounting-master/deliverables/P08/progress.md'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"# P08 implementation checkpoint\\n\\n2026-10-03. Recovery and structured approved plan/review inspected. The two\\nrequired deliverables, engine, checker and test file are absent. Prior stopped\\nplanning work supplies no implementation evidence. Approved scope is a synthetic\\nissuer compound convertible bond; MC06/15/17/19/29/30 and G4/G7/G8 stay wider.\\n\\n## Pre-execution skeptical audit and evidence contract\\n\\nQuestion: can applicable primary authority support a parameterized, exact issuer\\nlifecycle and same-fact comparison? Comparator: existing compound-bond dossier\\n(arithmetic regression only), independently derived present values and cash flows.\\nPass: inspected applicable recognition/measurement/classification/settlement\\nanchors, parameterized atomic journals, both multi-period settlements, matched\\ninputs and reproducible notes. Vetoes: unsupported authority blocks the affected\\ntreatment; invalid dates, ineligible terms, imbalance, negative funding or state\\nmismatch block implementation acceptance. Source failures do not stop independent\\npreparation. No short check establishes accounting compliance, forecast validity,\\nhuman acceptance, superiority or whole-gap closure. Result and source/hash evidence\\nwill be preserved in authority-and-methods.json and result.md.\\n\\nDefaults audit: annual periods, two coupons, fixed shares, functional currency,\\nno fees/tax/options and 10% comparable yield come from the reviewed synthetic\\nexample (hypotheses, not real-market estimates). Wrong eligibility or yield can\\nproduce balanced but wrong accounting: reject unsupported clauses and independently\\ncheck PV, alternative parameters and authority applicability. Australian for-profit\\nTier 1 basis is a bounded scope choice; check edition and period-start limits.\\nOpening cash/equity 20 is synthetic settlement funding; test insufficient cash and\\natomic rollback. Exact rational arithmetic is an engineering choice; this does not\\nvalidate real currency rounding. Inspection dates do not substitute for effective\\nperiods. Matched comparisons hold economics fixed; absent sources stay unresolved.\\n\\nAudit passes for this bounded plan: no ranking/proxy promotion, source-dependent\\nstops are local, and exact outputs answer only the stated conformance question.\\n\\n## Files and next steps\\n\\nDeclared new files: scripts/corporate_financing_v1.py,\\nscripts/check_accounting_p08.py, tests/test_accounting_p08.py,\\ndocs/design/research/p08-v1/*, and the three permitted P08 files. Existing dossier,\\nshared engines, frozen corpus and protected supervisor files remain preserved.\\nNext: inspect applicable AASB 9, AASB 132 and a legitimate primary comparator;\\nrecord source-specific access outcomes; implement engine, generate cases, test\\nnegative paths and run unittest plus checker --check. All deliverables unfinished.\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T233421-cea9e631/P08/execution-1/repair-1.log:29:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_11\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc \\\"rg -n \\\\\\\"P08|authority-and-methods|check_accounting_p08|corporate_financing\\\\\\\" scripts tests docs data/accounting-master -g '\\\"'!data/accounting-master/runs/**'\\\"' | sed -n '1,240p'\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"docs/plans/accounting-master-checkpoint.md:56:| P08 | Needs repair, independently eligible | Prior planning interruption is resumable. |\\ndata/accounting-master/active-process.json:27:    \\\"/home/chakwong/python/AccDSL/data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T233421-cea9e631/P08/execution-1/repair-1.response.json\\\",\\ndata/accounting-master/active-process.json:44:  \\\"log\\\": \\\"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T233421-cea9e631/P08/execution-1/repair-1.log\\\"\\ndata/accounting-master/next-plan.json:29:    \\\"P08\\\",\\ndata/accounting-master/next-plan.json:42:    \\\"P08\\\": \\\"running\\\",\\ndata/accounting-master/next-plan.json:95:    \\\"P08\\\": [],\\ndata/accounting-master/next-plan.json:131:    \\\"P08\\\": [\\ndata/accountin