sent sources stay unresolved.\\\\n\\\\nAudit passes for this bounded plan: no ranking/proxy promotion, source-dependent\\\\nstops are local, and exact outputs answer only the stated conformance question.\\\\n\\\\n## Files and next steps\\\\n\\\\nDeclared new files: scripts/corporate_financing_v1.py,\\\\nscripts/check_accounting_p08.py, tests/test_accounting_p08.py,\\\\ndocs/design/research/p08-v1/*, and the three permitted P08 files. Existing dossier,\\\\nshared engines, frozen corpus and protected supervisor files remain preserved.\\\\nNext: inspect applicable AASB 9, AASB 132 and a legitimate primary comparator;\\\\nrecord source-specific access outcomes; implement engine, generate cases, test\\\\nnegative paths and run unittest plus checker --check. All deliverables unfinished.\\\\nEOF\\\\npython3 -B - <<'PY'\\\\nimport pathlib,hashlib,json\\\\np=pathlib.Path('data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T233421-cea9e631/P08/phase-entry-inventory.json')\\\\nd=json.loads(p.read_text()); print('Inventory entries',len(d))\\\\nfor f in ['AGENTS.md','docs/design/research/standards/aasb132.pdf','docs/design/review/accounting-dossiers/compound-bond.md']:\\\\n print(f,hashlib.sha256(pathlib.Path(f).read_bytes()).hexdigest())\\\\nPY\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"aggregated_output\\\":\\\"Inventory entries 401\\\\nAGENTS.md c0a6c1d6f06760ac148a97fe1be871dd3210e0d55897bc2e8ecf7cfd01554807\\\\ndocs/design/research/standards/aasb132.pdf 5c8ce25447c6186ec49f751bc9e7ad48563caaff542b0e0287f3f7783a480501\\\\ndocs/design/review/accounting-dossiers/compound-bond.md 6833cf448ac1d1ebdf23f5e78be5bbf76210624a160538a7921469075ced1196\\\\n\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"}}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"item.started\\\",\\\"item\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"item_6\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_execution\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"/bin/bash -lc \\\\\\\"rg -n 'AG30|AG31|AG32|fixed number|before 1 July|Aus1|Tier 1|For-profit|28 |29 |30 |31 |32 ' docs/design/research/standards/aasb132.txt | head -48\\\\npython3 -